yle="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.18%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_1BmhzUpiBkehOYq6oVxzbw" contextRef="As_Of_3_11_2022_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ambo_BeijingNormalUniversityAmbowEducationTechnologyCo.LtdMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_EastWestBankMember_HV9vOO11fEKjzDJ0ZBLwBA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Tc_zz_3LAVtpUiAjisRED3Lcw_5_8">2.50</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.47%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">%&#xA0;&#xA0;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:14.76%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">January 6, 2024</p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#x200B;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">In 2022 and January 2023, the Group pledged its restricted cash amount of $ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_fUwO6DKG90KmYldMzD9dsA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_CathyBankMember_9bjpau8JrEqxw3D2StfsmQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="ambo:MortgagedPropertyAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_5VSkEtQcNU-imHjr2jpPmA">5,439</ix:nonFraction> to <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_jLtIXHrBtEKtx925s3qLGA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">obtain</span></span> a line of credit of $ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_fUwO6DKG90KmYldMzD9dsA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_CathyBankMember_PsPvpa0d7kio56w0ffwVBQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LinesOfCreditCurrent" scale="3" id="Narr_sEkZ-rcTkEC7T59uREbJIQ">5,439</ix:nonFraction> from Cathy Bank and EAST WEST BANK, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden__SXF54uNj0iwAbJHBN0Ugg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">respectively</span></span>. Refer to Note 4-Cash, Cash Equivalents and Restricted Cash.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#x200B;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On October 11, 2022, the Group received a loan from Cathy Bank in the amount of $ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_fUwO6DKG90KmYldMzD9dsA" contextRef="Duration_10_11_2022_To_10_11_2022_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_CathyBankMember_Uwio9tAJM0mFjS-Sl778bQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoanOriginations1" scale="3" id="Narr_RaAuGEcyQkOhD-34atwTHg">1,500</ix:nonFraction> with a maturity date of October 11, 2023, and bearing interest at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_1BmhzUpiBkehOYq6oVxzbw" contextRef="As_Of_10_11_2022_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_CathyBankMember_D_UAlHzNOUO2To6M6wclCw" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ui2rNDimjEaKPNgTePSInw">4.46</ix:nonFraction>% per annum. On November 14, 2022, the Group received a loan from EAST WEST BANK in the amount of $ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_fUwO6DKG90KmYldMzD9dsA" contextRef="Duration_11_14_2022_To_11_14_2022_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_EastWestBankMember_paWxS_sfx0KTaLN7iSaf_g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoanOriginations1" scale="3" id="Narr_RQ8H7m6dnEeMYRcf26uh4Q">1,500</ix:nonFraction> with a maturity date of November 14, 2023, and bearing interest at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_1BmhzUpiBkehOYq6oVxzbw" contextRef="As_Of_11_14_2022_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_EastWestBankMember_goa7YA-aLkeMUdgN47EfQQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_lyUe5wllW0OcAzvJZCQURA">2.50</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, and the loan has been fully repaid before the issuance of the condensed consolidated financial statements. On January 6, 2023, the Group received a loan from EAST WEST BANK in the amount of $ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_fUwO6DKG90KmYldMzD9dsA" contextRef="Duration_1_6_2023_To_1_6_2023_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_EastWestBankMember_MgDHYcZbfki2A-NW_g-M-Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoanOriginations1" scale="3" id="Narr_bNnboc0XOUm0YwY33jIITg">2,439</ix:nonFraction> with a maturity date of January 6, 2024, and bearing interest at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_1BmhzUpiBkehOYq6oVxzbw" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2023_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_ambo_EastWestBankMember_kCP2XaTGbU-H9tsO2fzmUw" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_oF7jYb8a80uZt7SFBiNw0g">2.50</ix:nonFraction>% per annum. The pledge shall be terminated once all borrowings are repaid, and pledge cancellation registration procedures are completed.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#x200B;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-11</p></div></div>
